{"id":"s1-3-2","courseId":"s1","chapterNumber":"3.2","title":"Derivasjonsreglar","description":"Lær dei grunnleggjande reglane for derivasjon av funksjonar.","estimatedMinutes":55,"competenceGoals":["derivere polynomfunksjonar, potens-, eksponential- og logaritmefunksjonar","bruke den deriverte til å analysere funksjonar"],"content":[{"id":"s1-3-2-intro","type":"text","content":"## Grunnleggjande derivasjonsreglar\n\nI staden for å bruke definisjonen kvar gong, brukar vi derivasjonsreglar som gjer arbeidet mykje enklare."},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-grunn","type":"theorem","title":"Grunnleggjande derivasjonsreglar","content":"**Konstant:** $(c)' = 0$\n\n**Potensregelen:** $(x^n)' = n \\cdot x^{n-1}$\n\n**Konstantmultiplikasjon:** $(c \\cdot f(x))' = c \\cdot f'(x)$\n\n**Sumregel:** $(f(x) + g(x))' = f'(x) + g'(x)$\n\n**Differanseregel:** $(f(x) - g(x))' = f'(x) - g'(x)$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-1","type":"example","title":"Derivere polynom","problem":"Deriver $f(x) = 3x^4 - 5x^2 + 2x - 7$.","solution":"Vi brukar potensregelen på kvart ledd:\n\n$$f'(x) = 3 \\cdot 4x^3 - 5 \\cdot 2x + 2 - 0$$\n$$= 12x^3 - 10x + 2$$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-geogebra","type":"geogebra","title":"Utforsk: Grafen til f og f' saman","description":"$f(x) = x^3 - 3x$ (blå) og den deriverte $f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3$ (raud). Legg merke til at $f'$ er null akkurat der $f$ har topp- og botnpunkt, og at $f'$ er negativ der $f$ synker.","appType":"graphing","commands":["f(x) = x^3 - 3x","g(x) = f'(x)","SetColor(f, \"Blue\")","SetColor(g, \"Red\")","Ekstremalpunkt(f)"]},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-prod","type":"theorem","title":"Produktregelen","content":"Dersom $f(x) = u(x) \\cdot v(x)$, så er:\n$$f'(x) = u'(x) \\cdot v(x) + u(x) \\cdot v'(x)$$\n\nHugseregel: \"derivert av første gonger andre pluss første gonger derivert av andre\""},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-2","type":"example","title":"Produktregelen","problem":"Deriver $f(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x^3 - 2x)$.","solution":"La $u = x^2 + 1$ og $v = x^3 - 2x$.\n$u' = 2x$ og $v' = 3x^2 - 2$.\n\n$$f'(x) = u'v + uv'$$\n$$= 2x(x^3 - 2x) + (x^2 + 1)(3x^2 - 2)$$\n$$= 2x^4 - 4x^2 + 3x^4 - 2x^2 + 3x^2 - 2$$\n$$= 5x^4 - 3x^2 - 2$$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-kvot","type":"theorem","title":"Kvotientregelen","content":"Dersom $f(x) = \\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$, så er:\n$$f'(x) = \\frac{u'(x) \\cdot v(x) - u(x) \\cdot v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2}$$\n\nHugseregel: \"derivert av teljar gonger nemnar minus teljar gonger derivert av nemnar, delt på nemnar i andre\""},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-3","type":"example","title":"Kvotientregelen","problem":"Deriver $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 - 1}{x + 2}$.","solution":"La $u = x^2 - 1$ og $v = x + 2$.\n$u' = 2x$ og $v' = 1$.\n\n$$f'(x) = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{2x(x + 2) - (x^2 - 1) \\cdot 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{2x^2 + 4x - x^2 + 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{x^2 + 4x + 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-theorem-eksp","type":"theorem","title":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjonar","content":"**Naturleg eksponential:** $(e^x)' = e^x$\n\n**Generell eksponential:** $(a^x)' = a^x \\cdot \\ln(a)$\n\n**Naturleg logaritme:** $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$\n\n**Generell logaritme:** $(\\log_a x)' = \\frac{1}{x \\cdot \\ln(a)}$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-example-4","type":"example","title":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjonar","problem":"Deriver:\na) $f(x) = 3e^x + 2\\ln x$\nb) $g(x) = 5^x$","solution":"a) $f'(x) = 3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$\n\nb) $g'(x) = 5^x \\cdot \\ln(5) \\approx 1{,}61 \\cdot 5^x$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-1","number":"1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = x^5$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 5x^4$","expressionAnswer":"5x^4"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = x^{-2}$.","solution":"$g'(x) = -2x^{-3} = -\\frac{2}{x^3}$","expressionAnswer":"-2/x^3"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-2","number":"2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = 4x^3 - 2x + 5$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 12x^2 - 2$","expressionAnswer":"12x^2-2"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x^6 - 3x^2$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 3x^5 - 6x$","expressionAnswer":"3x^5-6x"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-3","number":"3","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\sqrt{x} = x^{1/2}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x^{-1/2} = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}$","expressionAnswer":["1/(2sqrt(x))","x^(-1/2)/2"]},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}} = x^{-1/2}$.","solution":"$g'(x) = -\\frac{1}{2}x^{-3/2} = -\\frac{1}{2x\\sqrt{x}}$","expressionAnswer":["-1/(2x*sqrt(x))","-x^(-3/2)/2"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-4","number":"4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = 2e^x - 5\\ln x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 2e^x - \\frac{5}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"2e^x-5/x"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = 3 \\cdot 2^x$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 3 \\cdot 2^x \\cdot \\ln 2 \\approx 2{,}08 \\cdot 2^x$","expressionAnswer":["3*2^x*log(2)","3*2^x*ln(2)"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-5","number":"5","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk produktregelen til å derivere $f(x) = x^2 \\cdot e^x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 2x \\cdot e^x + x^2 \\cdot e^x = e^x(2x + x^2) = xe^x(2 + x)$","expressionAnswer":["xe^x*(2+x)","x*e^x*(2+x)","2xe^x+x^2*e^x"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-6","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-6","number":"6","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk produktregelen til å derivere $f(x) = (x + 1)(x^2 - 3)$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot (x^2 - 3) + (x + 1) \\cdot 2x$\n$= x^2 - 3 + 2x^2 + 2x = 3x^2 + 2x - 3$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2+2x-3"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-7","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-7","number":"7","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk kvotientregelen til å derivere $f(x) = \\frac{x}{x + 1}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1) - x \\cdot 1}{(x+1)^2} = \\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$","expressionAnswer":"1/(x+1)^2"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-8","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-8","number":"8","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Bruk kvotientregelen til å derivere $f(x) = \\frac{e^x}{x}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{e^x \\cdot x - e^x \\cdot 1}{x^2} = \\frac{e^x(x - 1)}{x^2}$","expressionAnswer":["e^x*(x-1)/x^2","e^x*(x-1)/x^2"]}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-9","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-9","number":"9","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = x \\cdot \\ln x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot \\ln x + x \\cdot \\frac{1}{x} = \\ln x + 1$","expressionAnswer":["ln(x)+1","log(x)+1"]},{"label":"b","task":"Finn $f'(e)$.","solution":"$f'(e) = \\ln e + 1 = 1 + 1 = 2$","answer":2}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-10","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-10","number":"10","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 2x}{x - 1}$.","solution":"$f'(x) = \\frac{(2x + 2)(x - 1) - (x^2 + 2x) \\cdot 1}{(x-1)^2}$\n$= \\frac{2x^2 - 2x + 2x - 2 - x^2 - 2x}{(x-1)^2}$\n$= \\frac{x^2 - 2x - 2}{(x-1)^2}$","expressionAnswer":"(x^2-2x-2)/(x-1)^2"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-11","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-11","number":"11","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Vis at $(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$ ved å bruke produktregelen for $f(x) = x \\cdot x^{n-1}$.","solution":"$f(x) = x \\cdot x^{n-1}$\n$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot x^{n-1} + x \\cdot (n-1)x^{n-2}$\n$= x^{n-1} + (n-1)x^{n-1}$\n$= nx^{n-1}$ ✓"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-block-12","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-ex-12","number":"12","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Løys oppgåvene:","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Finn $f'(x)$ og $f''(x)$ for $f(x) = x^3e^x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 3x^2e^x + x^3e^x = e^x(3x^2 + x^3) = x^2e^x(3 + x)$\n\n$f''(x) = (6x + 3x^2)e^x + (3x^2 + x^3)e^x$\n$= e^x(6x + 3x^2 + 3x^2 + x^3)$\n$= e^x(x^3 + 6x^2 + 6x)$\n$= xe^x(x^2 + 6x + 6)$"}]}},{"id":"s1-3-2-oppsummering","type":"text","content":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Grunnreglar**: $(c)' = 0$, $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$, $(cf)' = cf'$, $(f \\pm g)' = f' \\pm g'$.\n- **Produktregelen**: $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$.\n- **Kvotientregelen**: $\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$.\n- **Eksponential og logaritme**: $(e^x)' = e^x$, $(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$, $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$.\n\n### Nøkkelomgrep\n| Omgrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Potensregelen | $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$ |\n| Produktregelen | Derivasjon av produkt av to funksjonar |\n| Kvotientregelen | Derivasjon av brøk |\n| Naturleg logaritme | $\\ln x$, har derivert $\\frac{1}{x}$ |\n\n### Viktige formlar\n- $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$\n- $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$\n- $\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\dfrac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$\n- $(e^x)' = e^x$, $(\\ln x)' = \\dfrac{1}{x}$, $(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$"},{"id":"s1-3-2-repetisjon","type":"collapsible","title":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","buttonText":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","content":[{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-1","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-1","number":"R1","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Deriver funksjonane.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = x^3$","solution":"$f'(x) = 3x^2$","expressionAnswer":"3x^2"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = 5x^2 - 4x + 7$","solution":"$g'(x) = 10x - 4$","expressionAnswer":"10x-4"},{"label":"c","task":"$h(x) = 8$","solution":"Konstant: $h'(x) = 0$","answer":0}],"solution":"a) $3x^2$  b) $10x - 4$  c) 0","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Potensregelen: $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$.","Den deriverte av ein konstant er null."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-2","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-2","number":"R2","type":"classic","difficulty":"lett","task":"Deriver funksjonane.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"$f(x) = 2x^4 - 3x^2$","solution":"$f'(x) = 8x^3 - 6x$","expressionAnswer":"8x^3-6x"},{"label":"b","task":"$g(x) = \\dfrac{1}{x}$","solution":"$g(x) = x^{-1}$, så $g'(x) = -x^{-2} = -\\frac{1}{x^2}$.","expressionAnswer":"-1/x^2"},{"label":"c","task":"$h(x) = e^x$","solution":"$h'(x) = e^x$ — eksponentialfunksjonen er sin eigen deriverte.","expressionAnswer":"e^x"}],"solution":"a) $8x^3 - 6x$  b) $-\\frac{1}{x^2}$  c) $e^x$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Skriv brøken som potens: $\\frac{1}{x} = x^{-1}$.","$(e^x)' = e^x$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-3","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-3","number":"R3","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Bruk produkt- og kvotientregelen.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x - 3)$.","solution":"Produktregelen: $f'(x) = 2x(x - 3) + (x^2 + 1) \\cdot 1 = 2x^2 - 6x + x^2 + 1 = 3x^2 - 6x + 1$.","expressionAnswer":"3x^2-6x+1"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = \\dfrac{x}{x + 1}$.","solution":"Kvotientregelen: $g'(x) = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1) - x \\cdot 1}{(x+1)^2} = \\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$.","expressionAnswer":"1/(x+1)^2"},{"label":"c","task":"Deriver $h(x) = \\ln x$.","solution":"$h'(x) = \\frac{1}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"1/x"}],"solution":"a) $3x^2 - 6x + 1$  b) $\\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$  c) $\\frac{1}{x}$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["$(uv)' = u'v + uv'$.","Kvotientregelen: $\\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-4","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-4","number":"R4","type":"classic","difficulty":"medium","task":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjonar.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = 3e^x + 2\\ln x$.","solution":"$f'(x) = 3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$","expressionAnswer":"3e^x+2/x"},{"label":"b","task":"Deriver $g(x) = 2^x$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 2^x \\ln 2$","expressionAnswer":"2^x*log(2)"},{"label":"c","task":"Rekn ut $h'(1)$ for $h(x) = x^2 + 3x$.","solution":"$h'(x) = 2x + 3$, så $h'(1) = 5$.","answer":5}],"solution":"a) $3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$  b) $2^x \\ln 2$  c) 5","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["$(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$.","Deriver først, set inn etterpå."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}},{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-5","type":"exercise","exercise":{"id":"s1-3-2-rep-ex-5","number":"R5","type":"classic","difficulty":"vanskelig","task":"Samansette derivasjonsoppgåver.","subTasks":[{"label":"a","task":"Deriver $f(x) = \\dfrac{x^2 - 1}{x + 2}$.","solution":"Kvotientregelen: $f'(x) = \\frac{2x(x+2) - (x^2-1)}{(x+2)^2} = \\frac{x^2 + 4x + 1}{(x+2)^2}$.","expressionAnswer":"(x^2+4x+1)/(x+2)^2"},{"label":"b","task":"Finn stigingstalet til tangenten til $g(x) = x^3 - 3x$ i $x = 2$.","solution":"$g'(x) = 3x^2 - 3$, så $g'(2) = 12 - 3 = 9$.","answer":9},{"label":"c","task":"For kva $x$ har $g(x) = x^3 - 3x$ horisontal tangent? Oppgi den positive verdien.","solution":"$3x^2 - 3 = 0$ gir $x = \\pm 1$. Positiv: $1$.","answer":1}],"solution":"a) $\\frac{x^2+4x+1}{(x+2)^2}$  b) 9  c) $x = 1$","hideInlineSolution":true,"hints":["Gang ut teljaren nøye i kvotientregelen.","Horisontal tangent: $g'(x) = 0$."],"allowsUpload":true,"allowsCanvasDrawing":true}}]}],"exercises":[],"_meta":{"sourceHash":"3d29a005b1bd8599","translatedAt":"2026-06-20T03:15:29.342Z","model":"claude-code-agent","strings":126,"tm":{"086e4aee23bdb77a":"Derivasjonsreglar","2ef9554ca605a089":"Lær dei grunnleggjande reglane for derivasjon av funksjonar.","13c2b17fe9be31bd":"derivere polynomfunksjonar, potens-, eksponential- og logaritmefunksjonar","51e51e659f80ad2d":"bruke den deriverte til å analysere funksjonar","84977680d1bde4dc":"## Grunnleggjande derivasjonsreglar\n\nI staden for å bruke definisjonen kvar gong, brukar vi derivasjonsreglar som gjer arbeidet mykje enklare.","54bfe2e11ffc9e81":"Grunnleggjande derivasjonsreglar","acc29fa166c8dc75":"**Konstant:** $(c)' = 0$\n\n**Potensregelen:** $(x^n)' = n \\cdot x^{n-1}$\n\n**Konstantmultiplikasjon:** $(c \\cdot f(x))' = c \\cdot f'(x)$\n\n**Sumregel:** $(f(x) + g(x))' = f'(x) + g'(x)$\n\n**Differanseregel:** $(f(x) - g(x))' = f'(x) - g'(x)$","a35d29b71edcad5c":"Derivere polynom","b676611a7e4aaf49":"Deriver $f(x) = 3x^4 - 5x^2 + 2x - 7$.","c5a72975c70e6612":"Vi brukar potensregelen på kvart ledd:\n\n$$f'(x) = 3 \\cdot 4x^3 - 5 \\cdot 2x + 2 - 0$$\n$$= 12x^3 - 10x + 2$$","f0823b877b304b55":"Utforsk: Grafen til f og f' saman","bbf1ef2a300ed8ca":"$f(x) = x^3 - 3x$ (blå) og den deriverte $f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3$ (raud). Legg merke til at $f'$ er null akkurat der $f$ har topp- og botnpunkt, og at $f'$ er negativ der $f$ synker.","44ba685640110c1d":"Produktregelen","50cd18cf2b566149":"Dersom $f(x) = u(x) \\cdot v(x)$, så er:\n$$f'(x) = u'(x) \\cdot v(x) + u(x) \\cdot v'(x)$$\n\nHugseregel: \"derivert av første gonger andre pluss første gonger derivert av andre\"","9c02a787a1fb174d":"Deriver $f(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x^3 - 2x)$.","0e3615f61640a92e":"La $u = x^2 + 1$ og $v = x^3 - 2x$.\n$u' = 2x$ og $v' = 3x^2 - 2$.\n\n$$f'(x) = u'v + uv'$$\n$$= 2x(x^3 - 2x) + (x^2 + 1)(3x^2 - 2)$$\n$$= 2x^4 - 4x^2 + 3x^4 - 2x^2 + 3x^2 - 2$$\n$$= 5x^4 - 3x^2 - 2$$","ce596530edfde2a9":"Kvotientregelen","5cd38ca019de22bf":"Dersom $f(x) = \\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}$, så er:\n$$f'(x) = \\frac{u'(x) \\cdot v(x) - u(x) \\cdot v'(x)}{[v(x)]^2}$$\n\nHugseregel: \"derivert av teljar gonger nemnar minus teljar gonger derivert av nemnar, delt på nemnar i andre\"","b292090ebf3b9942":"Deriver $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 - 1}{x + 2}$.","5307a4ba94571665":"La $u = x^2 - 1$ og $v = x + 2$.\n$u' = 2x$ og $v' = 1$.\n\n$$f'(x) = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{2x(x + 2) - (x^2 - 1) \\cdot 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{2x^2 + 4x - x^2 + 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$\n$$= \\frac{x^2 + 4x + 1}{(x + 2)^2}$$","b6e9f6ea1d59ce8a":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjonar","13412d85ae18dcfa":"**Naturleg eksponential:** $(e^x)' = e^x$\n\n**Generell eksponential:** $(a^x)' = a^x \\cdot \\ln(a)$\n\n**Naturleg logaritme:** $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$\n\n**Generell logaritme:** $(\\log_a x)' = \\frac{1}{x \\cdot \\ln(a)}$","b53ef5d8450c3ada":"Deriver:\na) $f(x) = 3e^x + 2\\ln x$\nb) $g(x) = 5^x$","fa94163f52dfdd29":"a) $f'(x) = 3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$\n\nb) $g'(x) = 5^x \\cdot \\ln(5) \\approx 1{,}61 \\cdot 5^x$","0b8fb02075a0f346":"Løys oppgåvene:","167d86ffb5373c03":"Deriver $f(x) = x^5$.","56248e9abafbdaf9":"$f'(x) = 5x^4$","bc5b01ba0a64142c":"Deriver $g(x) = x^{-2}$.","d71696e7892423a2":"$g'(x) = -2x^{-3} = -\\frac{2}{x^3}$","2d1ed4d2fb1609a5":"Deriver $f(x) = 4x^3 - 2x + 5$.","6046248d7d6a7b01":"$f'(x) = 12x^2 - 2$","2811745726eac684":"Deriver $g(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x^6 - 3x^2$.","419d94dfb41ae120":"$g'(x) = 3x^5 - 6x$","e2d327f032b1aac1":"Deriver $f(x) = \\sqrt{x} = x^{1/2}$.","68f71b606705acb0":"$f'(x) = \\frac{1}{2}x^{-1/2} = \\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}$","2979ca84537f251b":"Deriver $g(x) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}} = x^{-1/2}$.","d5593a91b8d1f95a":"$g'(x) = -\\frac{1}{2}x^{-3/2} = -\\frac{1}{2x\\sqrt{x}}$","bf75c36ef69f5f37":"Deriver $f(x) = 2e^x - 5\\ln x$.","eb2eb34964fc3dec":"$f'(x) = 2e^x - \\frac{5}{x}$","142f65ffcbaf46ce":"Deriver $g(x) = 3 \\cdot 2^x$.","c894a3821591fd45":"$g'(x) = 3 \\cdot 2^x \\cdot \\ln 2 \\approx 2{,}08 \\cdot 2^x$","7bb46a6bb2e6c58c":"Bruk produktregelen til å derivere $f(x) = x^2 \\cdot e^x$.","be03c9d350d99151":"$f'(x) = 2x \\cdot e^x + x^2 \\cdot e^x = e^x(2x + x^2) = xe^x(2 + x)$","4453c9028877f75a":"Bruk produktregelen til å derivere $f(x) = (x + 1)(x^2 - 3)$.","0eb6c1b9af3a18ca":"$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot (x^2 - 3) + (x + 1) \\cdot 2x$\n$= x^2 - 3 + 2x^2 + 2x = 3x^2 + 2x - 3$","51a56e3a7cc34950":"Bruk kvotientregelen til å derivere $f(x) = \\frac{x}{x + 1}$.","d8cb38db61a7b7ca":"$f'(x) = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1) - x \\cdot 1}{(x+1)^2} = \\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$","2f53745cb3e5bf2c":"Bruk kvotientregelen til å derivere $f(x) = \\frac{e^x}{x}$.","2ac4dc680fbc6732":"$f'(x) = \\frac{e^x \\cdot x - e^x \\cdot 1}{x^2} = \\frac{e^x(x - 1)}{x^2}$","7502e72abb57635d":"Deriver $f(x) = x \\cdot \\ln x$.","32e49b053a7c4bdc":"$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot \\ln x + x \\cdot \\frac{1}{x} = \\ln x + 1$","0b2dcb984832fbf8":"Finn $f'(e)$.","566467acea72046a":"$f'(e) = \\ln e + 1 = 1 + 1 = 2$","a83591be8cc44f48":"Deriver $f(x) = \\frac{x^2 + 2x}{x - 1}$.","636245ad372a72ce":"$f'(x) = \\frac{(2x + 2)(x - 1) - (x^2 + 2x) \\cdot 1}{(x-1)^2}$\n$= \\frac{2x^2 - 2x + 2x - 2 - x^2 - 2x}{(x-1)^2}$\n$= \\frac{x^2 - 2x - 2}{(x-1)^2}$","eae7d5c1f9e81749":"Vis at $(x^n)'=nx^{n-1}$ ved å bruke produktregelen for $f(x) = x \\cdot x^{n-1}$.","ef30e0db4fe40e49":"$f(x) = x \\cdot x^{n-1}$\n$f'(x) = 1 \\cdot x^{n-1} + x \\cdot (n-1)x^{n-2}$\n$= x^{n-1} + (n-1)x^{n-1}$\n$= nx^{n-1}$ ✓","c053cc6641ff1715":"Finn $f'(x)$ og $f''(x)$ for $f(x) = x^3e^x$.","7935c660d085632f":"$f'(x) = 3x^2e^x + x^3e^x = e^x(3x^2 + x^3) = x^2e^x(3 + x)$\n\n$f''(x) = (6x + 3x^2)e^x + (3x^2 + x^3)e^x$\n$= e^x(6x + 3x^2 + 3x^2 + x^3)$\n$= e^x(x^3 + 6x^2 + 6x)$\n$= xe^x(x^2 + 6x + 6)$","be875f280cdddc0e":"## Oppsummering\n\nI dette kapittelet har du lært:\n\n- **Grunnreglar**: $(c)' = 0$, $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$, $(cf)' = cf'$, $(f \\pm g)' = f' \\pm g'$.\n- **Produktregelen**: $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$.\n- **Kvotientregelen**: $\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$.\n- **Eksponential og logaritme**: $(e^x)' = e^x$, $(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$, $(\\ln x)' = \\frac{1}{x}$.\n\n### Nøkkelomgrep\n| Omgrep | Forklaring |\n|--------|------------|\n| Potensregelen | $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$ |\n| Produktregelen | Derivasjon av produkt av to funksjonar |\n| Kvotientregelen | Derivasjon av brøk |\n| Naturleg logaritme | $\\ln x$, har derivert $\\frac{1}{x}$ |\n\n### Viktige formlar\n- $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$\n- $(uv)' = u'v + uv'$\n- $\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right)' = \\dfrac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$\n- $(e^x)' = e^x$, $(\\ln x)' = \\dfrac{1}{x}$, $(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$","f0db7f3333b88fb5":"Repetisjonsoppgåver","cc813884c5a66fe6":"Vis repetisjonsoppgåver","aca4505add985687":"Deriver funksjonane.","e987cf6775dc89a3":"$f(x) = x^3$","1abf2bbd9f562796":"$f'(x) = 3x^2$","fe7671c2b661c2fb":"$g(x) = 5x^2 - 4x + 7$","95a45f56bf80efce":"$g'(x) = 10x - 4$","8f780a6e36fbe2a8":"$h(x) = 8$","f67d0972133a21d5":"Konstant: $h'(x) = 0$","8df45e81a91c4a40":"a) $3x^2$  b) $10x - 4$  c) 0","516111256e633e14":"Potensregelen: $(x^n)' = nx^{n-1}$.","e508388115271d25":"Den deriverte av ein konstant er null.","399cebf45326a742":"$f(x) = 2x^4 - 3x^2$","987ccd21c194b439":"$f'(x) = 8x^3 - 6x$","58f7bd4746ac7b94":"$g(x) = \\dfrac{1}{x}$","5301232cd0dc29c8":"$g(x) = x^{-1}$, så $g'(x) = -x^{-2} = -\\frac{1}{x^2}$.","655fff1e02ca444f":"$h(x) = e^x$","e15a36d51d7588e7":"$h'(x) = e^x$ — eksponentialfunksjonen er sin eigen deriverte.","84a98b6eeee9c4b1":"a) $8x^3 - 6x$  b) $-\\frac{1}{x^2}$  c) $e^x$","4b079d1a86c10dae":"Skriv brøken som potens: $\\frac{1}{x} = x^{-1}$.","0f1d375b164e04e4":"$(e^x)' = e^x$.","47d4a4142a3561b7":"Bruk produkt- og kvotientregelen.","4e1109575fd37cc2":"Deriver $f(x) = (x^2 + 1)(x - 3)$.","462d9bc8334fef38":"Produktregelen: $f'(x) = 2x(x - 3) + (x^2 + 1) \\cdot 1 = 2x^2 - 6x + x^2 + 1 = 3x^2 - 6x + 1$.","e1f07605a730d7b1":"Deriver $g(x) = \\dfrac{x}{x + 1}$.","cb5c907a119ae8fd":"Kvotientregelen: $g'(x) = \\frac{1 \\cdot (x+1) - x \\cdot 1}{(x+1)^2} = \\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$.","9d4633072819af18":"Deriver $h(x) = \\ln x$.","beba9d073b5263ce":"$h'(x) = \\frac{1}{x}$","64998adacf7a2c1e":"a) $3x^2 - 6x + 1$  b) $\\frac{1}{(x+1)^2}$  c) $\\frac{1}{x}$","6a4072de50715e91":"$(uv)' = u'v + uv'$.","2803818906a94320":"Kvotientregelen: $\\frac{u'v - uv'}{v^2}$.","804d8157a7b3bbb2":"Eksponential- og logaritmefunksjonar.","4fda1bf17545d354":"Deriver $f(x) = 3e^x + 2\\ln x$.","b3122a7656939717":"$f'(x) = 3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$","36e1e77262644222":"Deriver $g(x) = 2^x$.","8b7b1b5f22dbdc87":"$g'(x) = 2^x \\ln 2$","a3bced36fbc883b0":"Rekn ut $h'(1)$ for $h(x) = x^2 + 3x$.","42a1b979be18bba6":"$h'(x) = 2x + 3$, så $h'(1) = 5$.","c2ac6bed1698167a":"a) $3e^x + \\frac{2}{x}$  b) $2^x \\ln 2$  c) 5","3dc98a2daaf4aa74":"$(a^x)' = a^x \\ln a$.","d1662cbaf3850a91":"Deriver først, set inn etterpå.","0f32288f4b69f697":"Samansette derivasjonsoppgåver.","8c2e062fdec3ef7a":"Deriver $f(x) = \\dfrac{x^2 - 1}{x + 2}$.","6b0a743bb96511b3":"Kvotientregelen: $f'(x) = \\frac{2x(x+2) - (x^2-1)}{(x+2)^2} = \\frac{x^2 + 4x + 1}{(x+2)^2}$.","cf9786e4ce130f53":"Finn stigingstalet til tangenten til $g(x) = x^3 - 3x$ i $x = 2$.","ec2f4d8fe4e6ed54":"$g'(x) = 3x^2 - 3$, så $g'(2) = 12 - 3 = 9$.","e5f51cc6d99aecfd":"For kva $x$ har $g(x) = x^3 - 3x$ horisontal tangent? Oppgi den positive verdien.","2598cc66222092ac":"$3x^2 - 3 = 0$ gir $x = \\pm 1$. Positiv: $1$.","aad4b087c1f0b3d9":"a) $\\frac{x^2+4x+1}{(x+2)^2}$  b) 9  c) $x = 1$","f0205292f6a9e02b":"Gang ut teljaren nøye i kvotientregelen.","77bd9a141b0dfbcc":"Horisontal tangent: $g'(x) = 0$."}}}